!Name: pd-crane
!C A pentadecathlon crane (or tractor beam).
!C This object "lifts" a pentadecathon upwards forever using repeated
!C impacts of glider pairs produced by four slide guns.  The impacts
!C occur every 94 generations each of which moves the pentadecathon
!C upwards by one cell and changes its phase by four generations.
!C The slide guns are driven by period 184 spaceship guns.
!C David I. Bell, 1 January 2009
